{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000001", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000002", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000003", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "picking the tasks that are too simple.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000002"}, {"quote": "very complicated extremely complicated scenario they pick and they fail to justify.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000003"}, {"quote": "they stay fail to highlight their contribution, also not able to mention the impact.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000004"}], "text": "Common mistakes include picking tasks that are too simple, choosing overly complicated scenarios, failing to highlight personal contribution, and not mentioning the impact of the project."}, "title": "Common Mistakes in Project Explanation", "topic": "interview preparation"}, "content_hash": "e2f861fb489d0dc889d4484c27f1fe40a1509998ef259d80d18d52e3e1cde871", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:knowledge:0095635485aeba18", "metadata_hash": "4f72256dd36f6b9def3f0a23d92c112e11826229931f33f8f46d8e6d11995153", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-02-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fbe964d11079f845694cf15771a24c33302cc6d96da69a9cb7664911286cb374", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PiUWrOx6Gg", "title": "Common Mistakes in Project Explanation", "topic": "interview preparation", "topic_slug": "interview-preparation"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000006", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000007"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "there's a only way to assess is like dig deeper and understand one of your past projects.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000006"}, {"quote": "assess your ability to handle challenges, your decision making and problem solving skills.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000007"}], "text": "Explaining past projects is important because it helps interviewers assess technical skills, decision making, and problem-solving abilities."}, "title": "Importance of Project Explanation in Interviews", "topic": "interview preparation"}, "content_hash": "e2f861fb489d0dc889d4484c27f1fe40a1509998ef259d80d18d52e3e1cde871", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:knowledge:b2cec9f943aebe53", "metadata_hash": "4f72256dd36f6b9def3f0a23d92c112e11826229931f33f8f46d8e6d11995153", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-02-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fbe964d11079f845694cf15771a24c33302cc6d96da69a9cb7664911286cb374", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PiUWrOx6Gg", "title": "Importance of Project Explanation in Interviews", "topic": "interview preparation", "topic_slug": "interview-preparation"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "do not overwhelm the interviewer.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000010"}], "text": "Do not overwhelm the interviewer with too much information."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "pick a decent size problem.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"}], "text": "The explanation should cover a decent-sized problem, not too trivial or overly complicated."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000008", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000009", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000010", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000011", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000012", "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"], "exceptions": [{"citations": [{"quote": "You can skip the lesson learned if you think like interview is not very interested.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"}], "text": "You can skip the lesson learned if the interviewer is not interested."}], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "do not overwhelm the interviewer.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000010"}], "text": "Effectively communicate past project experiences in interviews."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Pick a challenge, provide context, highlight your role, explain your approach, share the result, explain the reflect the lesson learned.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000010"}], "text": "Pick a challenge that highlights your skills."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Provide context like I wouldn't know about your product very well.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000009"}], "text": "Provide context about the product and your role."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "explain like what is the problem, what was your approach, how you solved it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"}], "text": "Explain your approach and the solution implemented."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "what is the impact.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"}], "text": "Share the results and impact of your work."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Lesson learned? The importance of profiling and back end collaboration.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000013"}], "text": "Reflect on lessons learned, if relevant."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Pick a challenge, provide context, highlight your role, explain your approach, share the result, explain the reflect the lesson learned.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000010"}], "text": "A structured approach to explaining past projects in interviews."}, "title": "Efficiently Answering Project Questions", "topic": "interview preparation"}, "content_hash": "e2f861fb489d0dc889d4484c27f1fe40a1509998ef259d80d18d52e3e1cde871", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:knowledge:54a0d6ed48e91e2c", "metadata_hash": "4f72256dd36f6b9def3f0a23d92c112e11826229931f33f8f46d8e6d11995153", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-02-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fbe964d11079f845694cf15771a24c33302cc6d96da69a9cb7664911286cb374", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PiUWrOx6Gg", "title": "Efficiently Answering Project Questions", "topic": "interview preparation", "topic_slug": "interview-preparation"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000014"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The best way probably according to you master this question very well is discuss with one of your peers who are relatively having more knowledge about the product.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:u000014"}], "text": "Discussing with knowledgeable peers or conducting mock interviews can help improve performance on project-related questions."}, "title": "Importance of Mock Interviews", "topic": "interview practice"}, "content_hash": "e2f861fb489d0dc889d4484c27f1fe40a1509998ef259d80d18d52e3e1cde871", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82:knowledge:1b59df82ba7ef492", "metadata_hash": "4f72256dd36f6b9def3f0a23d92c112e11826229931f33f8f46d8e6d11995153", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-02-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fbe964d11079f845694cf15771a24c33302cc6d96da69a9cb7664911286cb374", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-01-mastering-the-tell-me-about-your-project-question-5piuwrox6g-6453de2b82", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PiUWrOx6Gg", "title": "Importance of Mock Interviews", "topic": "interview practice", "topic_slug": "interview-practice"}
